"}]},"markers":[{"id":"jFSRUqjuEts","position":37,"timestamp":"00:54:19","rawTrack":"Dr. Dre - B***h N****z (Instrumental)","track":{"id":"brcESzFECcg","path":"/artists/dr-dre/tracks/b-h-n-z-instrumental/","slug":"bh-nz-instrumental","title":"B***h N****z (Instrumental)","artist":{"slug":"dr-dre","title":"Dr. Dre"},"artwork":"images/artists/dr-dre/tracks/b-h-n-z-instrumental.jpg"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"o27ZYCf_aK0","slug":"all-day-2021","tags":[6,3,19],"links":{"appleMusic":"https://music.apple.com/gb/station/soulection-all-day-joe-kay/ra.1546296427","soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/sets/soulection-all-day"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection All Day 2021","artwork":"images/episodes/487-5-joe-kay.jpg","content":"**🎊🌟 Happy New Year 2021 🌟🎊**\n\nA day of exclusive mixes from [Joe Kay](/episodes/all-day-2021/#joe-kays-set), [Austin Marc](/episodes/all-day-2021/#austin-marcs-set), [Minzi Roberta](/episodes/all-day-2021/#minzi-robertas-set), and [See Dee](/episodes/all-day-2021/#see-dees-set).\n\n<!--more-->\n\n#### Jump to:\n\n- [Joe Kay's Set](/episodes/all-day-2021/#joe-kays-set) - Los Angeles 🇺🇸\n- [Austin Marc](/episodes/all-day-2021/#austin-marcs-set) - New York 🇺🇸\n- [Minzi Roberta](/episodes/all-day-2021/#minzi-robertas-set) - Toronto 🇨🇦\n- [See Dee](/episodes/all-day-2021/#see-dees-set) - Paris 🇫🇷\n\n\nAlso listen to [Soulection All Day 2020](/episodes/all-day-2020/), or [Soulection All Day 2019](/episodes/all-day-2019/).\n","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":28800,"location":"US","published_at":"2021-01-01T01:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay's Set","position":0}},{"id":"qulob4V9tgM","position":47,"timestamp":"01:38:35","rawTrack":"Dr. Dre - B***h N****z (Instrumental)","track":{"id":"brcESzFECcg","path":"/artists/dr-dre/tracks/b-h-n-z-instrumental/","slug":"bh-nz-instrumental","title":"B***h N****z (Instrumental)","artist":{"slug":"dr-dre","title":"Dr. Dre"},"artwork":"images/artists/dr-dre/tracks/b-h-n-z-instrumental.jpg"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"zOMAi1e9mK4","slug":"505","tags":[6,6,15],"links":{"appleMusic":"https://music.apple.com/gb/station/episode-505/ra.1566918949","soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-505"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #505","artwork":"images/episodes/soulection-radio-show-505.png","content":"Nostalgic R&B classics blended with some new sounds.\n<!--more-->\n","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":7200,"location":"US","published_at":"2021-05-15T00:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay's Session","position":0}},{"id":"gqDvAKU1Vc8","position":48,"timestamp":"01:40:55","rawTrack":"Dr. Dre - The Message (Instrumental)","track":{"id":"uX61XhQcKnM","path":"/artists/dr-dre/tracks/the-message-instrumental/","slug":"the-message-instrumental","title":"The Message (Instrumental)","artist":{"slug":"dr-dre","title":"Dr. Dre"},"artwork":"images/artists/dr-dre/tracks/the-message-instrumental.jpg"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"zOMAi1e9mK4","slug":"505","tags":[6,6,15],"links":{"appleMusic":"https://music.apple.com/gb/station/episode-505/ra.1566918949","soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-505"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #505","artwork":"images/episodes/soulection-radio-show-505.png","content":"Nostalgic R&B classics blended with some new sounds.\n<!--more-->\n","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":7200,"location":"US","published_at":"2021-05-15T00:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay's Session","position":0}},{"id":"SQUuGBkIgcE","position":103,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"Dr. Dre - The Message","track":{"id":"SdRAa9XQpZw","path":"/artists/dr-dre/tracks/the-message/","slug":"the-message","title":"The Message","artist":{"slug":"dr-dre","title":"Dr. Dre"},"artwork":"images/artists/dr-dre/tracks/the-message.jpg"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"6HHQNRsrLR0","slug":"146","tags":[1,3,15],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-146"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #146","artwork":"/images/episodes/146.jpg","content":"Joe Kay hits hard with 3 hours of HEAVY tracks on 1 hour of sleep\n\n<!--more-->\n\n\nThere is something for everybody in here. Lots of unreleased music + music that was forgotten about. Shouts to all the amazing people who tuned in to the live show. Every once in a while we like to make a post about the location of our radio listeners and it's always inspiring to see how many people are actually tuning in and the locations that they reside in. We can't even pronounce some of the cities/countries! Talk about worldwide. Lets keep it moving.\n\n\nThanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) for supplying this tracklist.\n","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":10814,"location":"US","published_at":"2013-09-28T01:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay's Set","position":0}},{"id":"rT6lHeoWOac","position":44,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"Dr. Dre - The Message (Instrumental)","track":{"id":"uX61XhQcKnM","path":"/artists/dr-dre/tracks/the-message-instrumental/","slug":"the-message-instrumental","title":"The Message (Instrumental)","artist":{"slug":"dr-dre","title":"Dr. Dre"},"artwork":"images/artists/dr-dre/tracks/the-message-instrumental.jpg"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"BDetsr-_b9I","slug":"154","tags":[1,15],"links":{},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #154","artwork":"/images/episodes/154.jpg","content":"Joe Kay really displayed a crazy selection of music that will have you copying/pasting consistently within Google for some time. \n\n<!--more-->\n\nThere are a lot of new tunes sprinkled with the 'feel-good' classics that we always connect to our sets. It's essential for us to keep educating you with the influences and how it all connects to where we are today. Spread this set to as many people as possible! More minds and ears need to hear this music!\n\nThanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) for supplying this tracklist.","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":10901,"location":"US","published_at":"2013-11-30T00:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay's Set","position":0}},{"id":"Wb6H4sQDY54","position":43,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"Dr. Dre - Xplosive (Slowed & Diced)","track":{"id":"eerjs_n2WTQ","path":"/artists/dr-dre/tracks/xplosive-slowed-diced/","slug":"xplosive-slowed-and-diced","title":"Xplosive (Slowed & Diced)","artist":{"slug":"dr-dre","title":"Dr. Dre"},"artwork":""},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"KGbt4wCudfQ","slug":"168","tags":[1,3,15],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-168-sxsw"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #168 (SXSW Pre Show)","artwork":"/images/episodes/168.jpg","content":"Joe kay getting you ready for SXSW.\n<!--more-->\n\nAs we are getting ready for SXSW we wanted to get you in the spirit. Joe Kay went solo again to keep things simple and focused. He kicked it off with the new Carmack/Esta collab, played some new discoveries/unreleased gems, and then switched up the whole format by letting the live listener selects the music by sending us our requests via our social media networks. What a beautiful thing! For over 2 hours, you had the chance to selects the music, Joe was just the provider! What a great way to collaborate right? Since we will be at SXSW from (March 11-16) there won't be a live Soulection Radio show next week, however, we do have a special guest mix to make up for it. Stay tuned.\n\nThanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) for supplying this tracklist.","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":10818,"location":"US","published_at":"2014-03-08T00:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay's Set","position":0}},{"id":"3hjZwH6ikbU","position":63,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"Dr. Dre - Xplosive (Instrumental) [Joe Kay’s Slowed Edit]","track":{"id":"aR35NVOZkbU","path":"/artists/dr-dre/tracks/xplosive-instrumental-joe-kay-s-slowed-edit/","slug":"xplosive-instrumental-joe-kays-slowed-edit","title":"Xplosive (Instrumental) [Joe Kay’s Slowed Edit]","artist":{"slug":"dr-dre","title":"Dr. Dre"},"artwork":""},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"Bd4yLv8Leyg","slug":"171","tags":[1,3,15],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-171"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #171","artwork":"/images/episodes/171.jpg","content":"Joe Kay returned with an immense amount and plenty of new ideas/inspiration after Coachella Weekend 1. \n\n<!--more-->\n\nThere are so many new gems in here. We also recently discovered this new platform/label out of Sydney called: [@flowfi](https://soundcloud.com/flowfi) (Accidentally spelled them out wrong on the show as F-L-O), but these guys are coming with HEAT. Make sure you pay attention to them. If you feel this whole session please share. Lets keep educating people with real music. Catch you next week at the same time.\n\nThanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) for supplying this tracklist.","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":10801,"location":"US","published_at":"2014-04-19T01:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay’s Session","position":0}},{"id":"6yfdJBI-j7Y","position":35,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"Dr. Dre - The Message (Instrumental)","track":{"id":"uX61XhQcKnM","path":"/artists/dr-dre/tracks/the-message-instrumental/","slug":"the-message-instrumental","title":"The Message (Instrumental)","artist":{"slug":"dr-dre","title":"Dr. Dre"},"artwork":"images/artists/dr-dre/tracks/the-message-instrumental.jpg"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"ds5J8Q4FpEQ","slug":"174","tags":[1,3,15],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-174-w-iman-omari"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #174 w/ Iman Omari","artwork":"/images/episodes/174.jpg","content":"Playing many tracks across 4 Sets\n<!--more-->\n\nThanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) for supplying this tracklist.\n","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":11043,"location":"US","published_at":"2014-05-10T01:00:00